    "# Generating a dataset of timeseries from a nonlinear dynamical system\n",
    "\n",
    "With ponds, this is done by *first* creating a regular dataset of timeseries that will serve as the forcing and *then* feed that dataset as a whole into a dynamical system that would show nonlinear dynamics. \n",
    "\n",
    "We can tweak PONDS core methods a bit to serve this purpose, and finally use `PONDS.apply_transformation()` to generate dataset.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Create a ponds object and choose a dynamical system\n",
    "\n",
    "Note: Yet, only the Lorenz system is implemented, and can be forced through the beta parameter."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 3,
